<![CDATA[<h1>Golang 笔记Day01 基础篇</h1><p>作者：Elari39（majo_elaina@qq.com）</p>
        
          <h2 id="1-编写第一个-go-程序">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-%e7%bc%96%e5%86%99%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%aa-go-%e7%a8%8b%e5%ba%8f"></a>
1. 编写第一个 Go 程序
</h2><h3 id="11-程序源码">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#11-%e7%a8%8b%e5%ba%8f%e6%ba%90%e7%a0%81"></a>
1.1 程序源码
</h3><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-go" data-lang="go"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">main</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;fmt&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">func</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Hello world!&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="12-运行和编译">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#12-%e8%bf%90%e8%a1%8c%e5%92%8c%e7%bc%96%e8%af%91"></a>
1.2 运行和编译
</h3><ul>
<li><strong>运行命令：</strong>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"><span class="line"><span class="cl">go run main.go
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li><strong>编译后运行：</strong>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"><span class="line"><span class="cl">go build main.go
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./main
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>💡 注意：</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>必须是 <code>main</code> 包：<code>package main</code></li>
<li>必须有 <code>main</code> 函数：<code>func main()</code></li>
<li>文件名不一定是 <code>main.go</code></li>
</ol>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 id="2-与其他编程语言的差异">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-%e4%b8%8e%e5%85%b6%e4%bb%96%e7%bc%96%e7%a8%8b%e8%af%ad%e8%a8%80%e7%9a%84%e5%b7%ae%e5%bc%82"></a>
2. 与其他编程语言的差异
</h2><h3 id="21-返回值">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#21-%e8%bf%94%e5%9b%9e%e5%80%bc"></a>
2.1 返回值
</h3><ul>
<li>Go 中 <code>main</code> 函数不支持任何返回值。</li>
<li>通过 <code>os.Exit()</code> 函数退出程序。</li>
</ul>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-go" data-lang="go"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">main</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;fmt&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;os&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">func</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Hello world!&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">os</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Exit</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p><strong>⚠️ 注意：</strong></p>
        
